{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/title_steam.gif?t=1748464563\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/PC_steam.gif?t=1748464563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">oneway.exe is a first-person, single player horror game, with a heavy focus on story and internet culture. Explore, survive and solve puzzles to find out what happened to UNTITLED.EXE, its developers, and understand why you're in the middle of it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the internet horrors that haunt your past. The ones you've never heard of. They don't exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A first-person horror game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CLICK ?? AWAY TO SURVIVE. FORWARD THE EMAIL? Find the hidden LINKS TO-----</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/HALLWAYpopups.gif?t=1748464563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>--an idyllic and highly animated --------, where the inhabitants seem to beeeeeeeeeeeeeee--</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/Door_steam.gif?t=1748464563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story of three developers, and <i>and</i> what it <strong>it</strong> takes to . A story of three developers,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Memories begin to unravel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The worst aspects of y/our Internet nostalgia put together for you to experience all over again in <strong>oneway.exe</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/ophie_gif_STEAM.gif?t=1748464563\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&gt; What does everyone want with you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/extras/steam_chara_preview_SMALL.gif?t=1748464563\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Frame-by-frame animated cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An immersive fully 3D world for you to explore. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An email from your coworker you just can\u2019t ignore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voiced dialogue. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your actions will have consequences. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be ready to face them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's how life works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original music by Marcy Nabors, known for her work in Homestuck, Hiveswap, and Deltarune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's just fiction.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2349570?t=1748464563","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748464563","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/04fd8e817c232c5ee28190968c7df9d0011104c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748464563","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2349570/04fd8e817c232c5ee28190968c7df9d0011104c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748464563","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"